CVE-2026-89161 exp:2026-12-01
# owner:@RonaldHensbergen — libsqlite3-0: arbitrary code execution via crafted FTS5 full-text search data, same fix
CVE-2026-11822 exp:2026-12-01
# owner:@RonaldHensbergen — libsqlite3-0: arbitrary code execution/crash via heap-based buffer overflow, same fix
CVE-2026-11824 exp:2026-12-01
# owner:@RonaldHensbergen — perl-base: incorrect regular expression processing via large regular expressions, same fix
CVE-2026-13221 exp:2026-12-01
# owner:@RonaldHensbergen — perl-base: perl-Archive-Tar path traversal via crafted symlinks, same fix
CVE-2026-42496 exp:2026-12-01
# owner:@RonaldHensbergen — perl-base: heap buffer overflow compiling regular expressions on 32-bit builds, same fix
CVE-2026-8376 exp:2026-12-01
# owner:@RonaldHensbergen — perl-base: perl-Archive-Tar arbitrary file modification via crafted hardlinks, same fix
CVE-2026-42497 exp:2026-12-01
